

run proxy server behind NAT on a LAN IP

set it to rewrite UDP ASSOC hostname to ext IP of the router
    "REWRITE_UDP_ASSOCIATE_IP_TO": "3.3.3.3"

set it to bind port range e.g. 20000..21000 
    "MIN_PORT_UDP_ASSOCIATE": 20000
    "MAX_PORT_UDP_ASSOCIATE": 21000

On router forward UDP  20000..21000 to the LAN IP of the proxy server

          forward TCP proxy port e.g. 5001  to the LAN IP of the proxy server

